ll}, {"sha": "1fd6713d7002688f93a8a773110f8461a86e80f7", "message": "Fixes date format for weapons workshop\n\nCorrects the date format for the weapons workshop event\nto ensure it is parsed correctly.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T16:41:29Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8ef3a2c4e3af4812ac3929be177c427f193c9573", "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master'", "created_at": "2025-08-31T16:39:30Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "187199808ce8fb2ed24811878ac48b534fc1cfd7", "message": "Corrects date formats in event data\n\nFixes inconsistencies in date formats within the event data.\nEnsures all dates adhere to the correct format for consistent interpretation.", "created_at": "2025-08-31T16:38:51Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6a881d690918c99160366a1142627ef3ef63b683", "message": "fix date (#41) (#42)\n\n* Update training-sessions.js\n\n* Fix date formats in training-sessions.js to mm/dd/yyyy\n\nCorrected the date format for the `otherEvents` array from dd/mm/yyyy to mm/dd/yyyy to ensure consistency and proper date handling. Updated the `seedDate` variable to use the American date format (mm/dd/yyyy) to align with the expected format and avoid potential issues with date parsing and calculations.\n\n* adjusted dates\n\n* Fix end date for Summer Course Llandudno event\n\nThe end date for the \"Summer Course Llandudno (50th Year Celebration)\" event has been corrected. The original end date was incorrectly set to February 8, 2025 (\"02/08/2025\"). It has been updated to the correct end date of August 2, 2025 (\"08/02/2025\").", "created_at": "2025-03-13T07:35:13Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5f6b98037d357fba8dd92a008de84f41a3fdaec1", "message": "Merge branch 'Live' into master", "created_at": "2025-03-13T07:34:15Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cb651b6554de1eb3a0cd5c370a29998c2859ca40", "message": "Merge branch 'master' of https://github.com/Ellamental2/LegacyLauGarWebsite", "created_at": "2025-03-13T07:32:59Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "900b9558ecfe076f25040f822e49ee19506e1fcb", "message": "Fix end date for Summer Course Llandudno event\n\nThe end date for the \"Summer Course Llandudno (50th Year Celebration)\" event has been corrected. The original end date was incorrectly set to February 8, 2025 (\"02/08/2025\"). It has been updated to the correct end date of August 2, 2025 (\"08/02/2025\").", "created_at": "2025-03-13T07:32:49Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ad443b0a9e69efecf72a8a2a9cf50e7d8949b09a", "message": "update 13.03.2025 (#40)\n\n* Update training-sessions.js\n\n* Fix date formats in training-sessions.js to mm/dd/yyyy\n\nCorrected the date format for the `otherEvents` array from dd/mm/yyyy to mm/dd/yyyy to ensure consistency and proper date handling. Updated the `seedDate` variable to use the American date format (mm/dd/yyyy) to align with the expected format and avoid potential issues with date parsing and calculations.\n\n* adjusted dates", "created_at": "2025-03-13T07:31:43Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c5a6e3d2629a5e820c12b0626b925945f3538886", "message": "Merge branch 'Live' into master", "created_at": "2025-03-13T07:31:29Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ba4a496645422d3fbbf77dae62ce2613cfadfb4b", "message": "adjusted dates", "created_at": "2025-03-13T07:29:28Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ea8da718a1b540b1e97015b79160c4e412950658", "message": "correct format (#39)\n\n* Update training-sessions.js\r\n\r\n* Fix date formats in training-sessions.js to mm/dd/yyyy\r\n\r\nCorrected the date format for the `otherEvents` array from dd/mm/yyyy to mm/dd/yyyy to ensure consistency and proper date handling. Updated the `seedDate` variable to use the American date format (mm/dd/yyyy) to align with the expected format and avoid potential issues with date parsing and calculations.", "created_at": "2025-01-13T09:12:10Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "429b899d0898886b80a86ec084f7f74e3faa8172", "message": "Merge branch 'Live' into master", "created_at": "2025-01-13T09:12:01Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d958a472ae43ab72c22439da131574edc089500f", "message": "Fix date formats in training-sessions.js to mm/dd/yyyy\n\nCorrected the date format for the `otherEvents` array from dd/mm/yyyy to mm/dd/yyyy to ensure consistency and proper date handling. Updated the `seedDate` variable to use the American date format (mm/dd/yyyy) to align with the expected format and avoid potential issues with date parsing and calculations.", "created_at": "2025-01-13T09:10:18Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9fa2d48b105d36b08ae191c613a19524c66006d6", "message": "Update training-sessions.js (#38)", "created_at": "2025-01-12T10:57:10Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "293b5c87a92ea3dcf779540c5729cf315a93525b", "message": "Update training-sessions.js", "created_at": "2025-01-12T10:54:08Z", "repo": "LegacyLauGarWebsite", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha":